# Sound Dip — edge redirects (Cloudflare Workers static assets).
#
# The newsletter button points at our own /newsletter/ path rather than the
# third-party Substack URL, so no other brand's name appears anywhere in
# sounddip.com markup. 302 (not 301) so the destination stays cheap to change.
# utm_source tags subscribers coming from this site, per the shared-list plan.

/newsletter/  https://substack.com/@nourishedjourneys?utm_source=sounddip  302
/newsletter   https://substack.com/@nourishedjourneys?utm_source=sounddip  302
